flowchart LR
    Boot[App or dock starts] --> English[English fallback in startup bundle]
    Boot --> Settings[Read saved app language]
    Settings --> Resolve[Match supported locale]
    Picker[Language selector] --> Resolve
    Resolve -->|English| Change[Change active i18n language]
    Resolve -->|Other language| Import[Load its translation chunk]
    Import -->|Success| Bundle[Add translation bundle]
    Bundle --> Change
    Import -->|Failure| Fallback[Keep current language and setting]
    Change --> UI[Translate app and dock]
